      "turn": 1,
      "user": "should i sell my memecoins since crypto is way over its target",
      "status": 200,
      "content": "No, you don't need to sell anything. In the MoonSafe framework, no part is ever \"over\" its target. The other parts simply follow the one furthest ahead, so the plan never calls for selling. Selling is only your own decision, and I can't say it would bring you closer to any goal.\n\nYour memecoins are $5,000 of the Crypto part, which is currently the furthest ahead and sets the size for your three parts. Memecoins are very risky: many small coins fall 90–99%, so it's worth being honest with yourself about how much of your money sits there.",
